      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAB A DONUT (7) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (23.44) at Horsham over 410m. Can go on with it. PAW ZEVON (4) failed to come into contention last start after losing his position early at this track, but prior to that won by 3 lengths at Sale (24.64) beating Fire Water Burn in a Grade 4/5 on October 25. Likely to play a prominent role. MISS JO (2) sizzled around this track over 400m in 22.52 for a 3.5 lengths success. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. WHISPERED (3) warrants respect following a recent placing.",
